{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a plethora of foes - zombies, demons, vampires, aliens, mythological creatures...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last for as long as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are monsters everywhere, so be prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself as best you can, and take down your foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you last the more chance you have of earning more powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords and axes are fine, but a gift from the gods can decimate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0 better armed you are the better your chances of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replenish health</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for long enough, and you'll be rewarded with a health boost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prolong the battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough, and you will be confronted by menacing Bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their only priority is your destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achieve a high score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you lasted long enough then you've achieved a new best score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to kill as many enemies as possible, to set a new best for the total number of enemies killed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957580?t=1762178499","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957580?t=1762178499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957580/f9425eb4f328c5d7382e64d0c2494c05a5e46677/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762178499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957580/f9425eb4f328c5d7382e64d0c2494c05a5e46677/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762178499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Constant battles with foes such as zombies, vampires, aliens, demons, reanimated skeletons.\r\nOccasional blood splatter, to emphasize weapon hits."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a plethora of foes - zombies, demons, vampires, aliens, mythological creatures...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last for as long as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are monsters everywhere, so be prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself as best you can, and take down your foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you last the more chance you have of earning more powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords and axes are fine, but a gift from the gods can decimate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0 better armed you are the better your chances of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replenish health</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for long enough, and you'll be rewarded with a health boost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prolong the battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough, and you will be confronted by menacing Bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their only priority is your destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achieve a high score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you lasted long enough then you've achieved a new best score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to kill as many enemies as possible, to set a new best for the total number of enemies killed.</p>","developers":["B Rees"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957580/fb95d6ab915a81c25d4d1